<title>USA: Hanaper Partners buys stake in Elmira.</title>
<headline>Hanaper Partners buys stake in Elmira.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanaper Partners L.P. said Thursday it acquired a 5.1 percent interest in Elmira Savings Bank.</p>
<p>Hanaper Partners, a private hedge fund which invests primarily in small capitalization equities, made the investment along with members of the Propp Hanaper family.</p>
<p>The partnership said it believes there is potential for a far greater return on shareholders' investment than is currently being realized.</p>
